NAME
       ln - make a symbolic link

SYNOPSIS
       ln -s target link_name
       ln -sf target link_name

DESCRIPTION
       Creates LINK_NAME pointing at TARGET. Cervus filesystems do not
       implement hard links, so -s is required.

OPTIONS
       -s     make a symbolic link (required)
       -f     remove an existing LINK_NAME first

SEE ALSO
       readlink(2), symlink(2)
